# Tmux actions
Toggle &synchronize-panes	@quiet tmux set -w synchronize-panes
&New session	@quiet tmux new-session -d
&Rename this window	@quiet tmux command-prompt -I "#W" "rename-window -- '%%'"
&Move window to session	@quiet tmux command-prompt -p "session:" "move-window -t '%%'"
&Clear this pane history	@quiet tmux clear-history
Res&pawn this pane	@quiet tmux-respawn
Re&load tmux.conf	@quiet tmux source-file ~/.tmux.conf
